msgstr "Nome host della CDN"

#: includes/importers
msgid "CDN: W3 Total Cache uploads your files to the CDN; WPOptimizing only points file addresses at a CDN host. Set the host in WPOptimizing's CDN settings."
msgstr "CDN: W3 Total Cache carica i tuoi file sulla CDN; WPOptimizing si limita a indirizzare gli URL dei file verso un host CDN. Imposta l’host nelle impostazioni CDN di WPOptimizing."

#: includes/importers
msgid "Object Cache: W3 Total Cache kept it in files on disk, which WPOptimizing does not offer. Choose Redis, Memcached or APCu in Cache › Object cache if the server has one."
msgstr "Cache degli oggetti: W3 Total Cache la teneva in file su disco, cosa che WPOptimizing non offre. Scegli Redis, Memcached o APCu in Cache › Cache degli oggetti se il server ne dispone."

#: includes/importers
